{"id": "60160", "title": "疯狂进化", "author": "谬尔", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 21, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60160.htm", "intro": "属性分类：未来／科幻世界／强攻强受／正剧\r\n关键字：袁霄 　陆深 　其他 \r\n\r\n【文案】\r\n\r\n袁霄的生活一直非常枯燥，人也十分简单。\r\n\r\n直到遇见那个总是冷著一张脸的人，他才学会了求生以外的情感，有了变强以外的目标。\r\n\r\n只是前一天还安安稳稳的睡在一起，怎么第二天就像变了个人似的将自己踢下床？\r\n\r\n嗳……什么？你有多重人格？", "base": "files/article/html/60/60160", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8820875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8820878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "8820880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "8820882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "8820883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "8820884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "8820886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "8820887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "8820892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "8820895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "8820897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "8820899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "8820900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "65-70", "file": "8820901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "8820903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "8820905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "8820907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-90", "file": "8820910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "8820911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-98", "file": "8820913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外H", "file": "8820916.html", "available": false}]}